From: Chad Monroe <chad@monroe.io>
Date: Tue, 18 Nov 2025 14:04:24 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7996: add per-band token limit

Multi-radio devices use a single token pool for all bands. Add
per-band token limit to prevent one band from interfering with
another.

Add debugfs files to dump current token state and the TXD/SKB
contents of a selected token for debugging.

Note: mt76_token_consume() gains a phy_idx argument, which touches
every driver using it (mt7915/mt7921/mt7925/mt7996).

Signed-off-by: Chad Monroe <chad@monroe.io>
